- **위계**:
  - Display: 28px / 700 / 1.2
  - H1: 22px / 600 / 1.25
  - H2: 18px / 600 / 1.3
  - H3: 16px / 500 / 1.35
  - Body Large: 16px / 400 / 1.5
  - Body: 14px / 400 / 1.45
  - Body Small: 13px / 500 / 1.4
  - Map label: 11px / 500 / 1 (지도 라벨)
  - Caption: 12px / 500 / 1.3

